# JustAC local pin: upstream ships no SimulationCraft list for this spec. Damage between
# heals for Holy, grounded at 12.1.0.69875. Holy Fire is a talent that replaces Shadow
# Word: Pain on the bar; Holy Word: Chastise grants two free, instant Holy Fires (Empyreal
# Blaze) and Smite / Holy Nova shorten its cooldown. Apotheosis and the other Holy Words
# are healing cooldowns and stay out of the damage queue. Archon's Halo damages as well as
# heals, so it is used on cooldown; Oracle adds no damage button. Anything the character does not know is dropped at runtime.

# Holy Fire on cooldown first: its own cooldown then runs while Chastise's free casts land.
actions=holy_fire
actions+=/holy_word_chastise
actions+=/halo,if=hero_tree.archon
# Without the Holy Fire talent, keep Shadow Word: Pain up instead.
actions+=/shadow_word_pain,if=!talent.holy_fire&refreshable
# Lightburst turns Holy Nova into a hard-hitting 30 sec nuke worth pressing at any count.
actions+=/holy_nova,if=talent.lightburst
actions+=/shadow_word_death,if=target.health.pct<20
actions+=/holy_nova,if=active_enemies>=3
actions+=/smite
